| Command           | Purpose                                          |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| `docker run`      | Create and start a container                     |
| `docker create`   | Create a container only                          |
| `docker start`    | Start an existing container                      |
| `docker stop`     | Stop a running container                         |
| `docker rm`       | Remove a container                               |
| `docker ps`       | List running containers                          |
| `docker ps -a`    | List all containers                              |
| `docker ps -aq`   | List all container IDs                           |
| `docker exec -it` | Open an interactive shell in a running container |
| `docker inspect`  | View detailed container information              |
| `docker cp`       | Copy files to/from a container                   |
| `docker logs`     | View container logs                              |
| `docker stats`    | Monitor live resource usage                      |
